    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i'm just... rotting everything from the inside. my family has this whole history of being these pillars of the community, so perfect and so strong, and then there's me. i'm just the stain on the tapestry. it feels like no matter what i do, i'm just dragging their name through the dirt.",
