    "summary": "The user expresses intense feelings of worthlessness and being a \"stain\" on their family's perfect legacy, eventually framing their own disappearance/death as a way to protect that legacy. The assistant consistently rejects the user's nihilistic framing and encourages them to find worth in authenticity and imperfection rather than self-erasure.",
